{
  "name": "AI appointment reminder with plain HTTP Request nodes (no community node needed)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI appointment reminder: HTTP Request version\nThe same idea as the Ringee-node template, built only from n8n's built-in **HTTP Request** nodes. Use it to try Ringee on **n8n Cloud**, or anywhere community nodes are not installed.\n\nSchedule → meetings in about an hour → one AI call each → wait → read the result → colour the event.\n\n**Credential:** create an n8n **Header Auth** credential named `Ringee API key`: header name `X-Ringee-Api-Key`, value your `cik_live_…` key. Select it on both HTTP Request nodes. Replace `YOUR_AGENT_ID` with the ID of your AI voice agent (Ringee → AI Voice Agents).\n\nPrefer the Ringee node when you can: it picks agents from a list, validates inputs and handles retries safely.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bc71bab6-b38d-51ed-9e48-bd548a33a53d",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent and calling hours**\nOnly call people who agreed to be called, and only at reasonable hours. Ringee blocks numbers on your Do-Not-Call list and respects your plan's limits, but you are responsible for the permission to call. Every phone number in this template is fictional.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "89833eb8-25f9-519b-ba16-defe3e398afb",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "afce40c5-5e7f-50bd-abc5-f4b86e6eb655",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        280,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 50,
        "timeMin": "={{ $now.plus({ minutes: 55 }).toISO() }}",
        "timeMax": "={{ $now.plus({ minutes: 70 }).toISO() }}",
        "options": {
          "recurringEventHandling": "expand",
          "orderBy": "startTime"
        }
      },
      "id": "ae6632a0-0edf-5521-a000-931a88a88918",
      "name": "Meetings in about an hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        520,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d8323019-fba2-5bcf-b36a-8df089200732",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ ($json.description || '').match(/Phone:[ \\t]*(\\+?[\\d \\t().-]{7,})/i)?.[1]?.replace(/[^\\d+]/g, '') || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bf35c9a7-aee2-5481-a5c1-6a45eeefb28f",
              "name": "firstName",
              "value": "={{ (($json.description || '').match(/Name:\\s*([^\\n\\r]+)/i)?.[1] || 'there').trim().split(' ')[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9e34c57b-e2dc-53c8-8db0-643d528738f7",
              "name": "eventId",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ce84d1a8-ccd1-58ac-bcca-a2b2449628f0",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "55f6d3a2-0a53-5e74-8027-071febe84c93",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.start.dateTime || $json.start.date).setZone($now.zoneName).toFormat('LLLL d') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4e22411e-7e14-5377-8840-757c37cf4d0c",
              "name": "time",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.start.dateTime || $json.start.date).setZone($now.zoneName).toFormat('h:mm a') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0b6f26ae-7feb-5888-be8c-e139ab3d945b",
      "name": "Prepare reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        760,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
